{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00246","headline":"唐大飨拜洛乐章 昭和 · 则天皇后","name":"唐大飨拜洛乐章 昭和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"舒云致养，合大资生。\n德以恒固，功由永贞。\n升歌荐序，垂币翘诚。\n虹开玉照，凤引金声。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"则天皇后","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00246.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00246","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}